Capabilities of SDKs that need a system service, and the certificates of those services' genuine
packages, collected by the Datapavan project and dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0
(https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/). Recorded in ADR 0015 and ADR 0021.
